      "gloss": "correct or amend",
      "comment": "Classically to free from faults, to correct, and especially to correct a text (Cic., Quint.; Lewis &amp; Short); applied here to fixing code. No reference work has a word for debugging. This covers correction generally; “debugging” can also include investigation before a fix exists."
